Compiled from plugins/rustledger-envelope in this repository:

  cd plugins/rustledger-envelope
  cargo build --release --target wasm32-unknown-unknown
  cp target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/release/rustledger_envelope.wasm ../../src-tauri/assets/

The app embeds this build (src-tauri/src/budget_write.rs, BUNDLED_PLUGIN), so a
reader can put the envelope module beside the journal without downloading it.
